    <param.summary>Speech Emotion Recognition Test, ©APP Lab BTNRH 2020
***NOT INTENDED FOR REDISTRIBUTION***</param.summary>
    <param.description>Please install in a location with write privileges, or "run as adminstrator" when installed.

New in Version 2.1.0 May 2020
Recompiled in Matlab R2020a
Replaced deprecated xlswrite() function by writecell() and writematrix()
Replaced rms() and hann() function with their analytical formula to remove dependency on Signal Processing Toolbox
Mat2xls can now convert multiple files.
Incorporated Mat2Xls() conversion toolbox in the main menu, can be summoned by Ctrl+M.
Replaced previous background images with solid color backgrounds for smaller app size.
Updated splash image and thumbnail icon.

New in Version 2.0.5 Mar 2020
solved the flickering issues between axes panels caused by the axes() command in newer versions of Matlab
fixed the calibrationmode malfunction
minor aesthetic fixes applied to the main screen

New in Version 2.0.4 Feb 2020
recompiled with MATLAB R2019b for Windows 10 compatibility and fixing the excel server issue.
uimenu callback property name changed from 'call' to 'MenuSelectedFcn'

New in Version 2.0.3
* Calibration mode crash resolved.
* Freezing issue resolved.
* Log file info improved.

New in Version 2.0.2
*Calibration Issue Resolved. A Pause button is now included.
*MException error in reading previous settings by textscan() resolved.

New in Version 2.0.1
*Amplitude normalization feature
*Waitbar pops up while generating reports and saving results
*Fixed Button repositioning issue for 4 emotions 

New in Version 2.0
*Passive training
*Choose 2-5 emotions to be tested
*Keep previous settings
*Calibration mode redesigned
*Additional stats provided for male/female inputs
*Improvements in PDF and Excel report generations
*Tooltipstring hints added on many buttons and textboxes
*Cosmetic improvements


Updates in Ver 1.14
Skips loading of non-WAV audio files. LED back to work.

Updates in Ver 1.13
TimerPeriod issue fixed, Volume Indicator LED back to work.

Updates in Ver 1.12
Prevent program shutdown after finishing the training
No blink of the green LED  after the end of the task.
default installation path changed.

Updates in Ver 1.11
Compatible with MATLAB R2015a and MCR 8.5
Standalone installer

Updates in Ver 1.1.0
Option to not have english/mandarin captions below smiley buttons.
Option to not see the results after the test is over.

Ver 1.09 Skipped

Updates in Ver. 1.08
Bug fixed in the training mode's last question 
An audio driver must be detected to proceed to the test

Updates in Ver. 1.07
Played sequence will be saved with corresponding audio filenames and the right or wrong answers to each. This can be helpful in eliminating troublesome recordings after awhile.
Output files renamed to a shorter format.

Updates in Ver 1.06
Cosmetic Improvements
Improved audio input recognition and warnings

Updates in Ver 1.05
Output .MAT files. 
Screen Size and Center Adjustments
Preventing total shutdown of the program
Load issue resolved
Opengl Software</param.description>
